# Copy to .env.postgres or .env.sqlserver and fill in real values.
# Use a DEDICATED database (its own schema is cleaned + regenerated by `gen`) — do NOT point this at the
# altea-test music DB or the eastwind app DB. ALTEA_AUTH_TEST_DB selects the dialect: a value starting with
# "postgres" uses the PostgreSQL connector, anything else uses the SQL Server connector.

# PostgreSQL (libpq URL form expected by node-pg):
# ALTEA_AUTH_TEST_DB=postgresql://USER:PASSWORD@HOST:5432/DBNAME

# SQL Server (mssql connection-string form; use a SQL login, not Windows auth):
# ALTEA_AUTH_TEST_DB=Server=HOST,PORT;Database=DBNAME;User Id=USER;Password=PASSWORD;TrustServerCertificate=true;Encrypt=true
